# The menus and the keyboard on a desktop (1280 x 800): Modes, How to play, Settings (a toggle, the
# palette), Scores, the Daily and Score Chase setups (typing a seed), then a deal played by keys: the
# board cursor (arrows), select and place (Enter), undo (Z), hint (H), pause (P) and resume, a drag on
# lesson 4, Restart and Concede with their confirmations, to the conceded results.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Daily Deal
frames 10
click =Modes
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
save modes
click =Close Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Help
until 120 Supermoves
frames 10
save help
click =Back
frames 10
click =Settings
until 120 Suit color palette
frames 10
save settings
click =Left-handed layout
frames 10
click =Done
frames 10
click =Scores
until 120 Achievements
frames 10
save scores
click =Close Scores & achievements
frames 10
click =Daily Deal
until 120 Play today’s deal
frames 10
save daily
key Escape 1
frames 10
click =Menu
until 120 Daily Deal
frames 10
click =Modes
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Open Score Chase
until 120 Roll a random seed
frames 10
click Challenge seed
frames 5
type brass-owl-42
frames 5
save chase
click =Play seed
until 300 chase-brass-owl-42
frames 30
# the board cursor: a press of Down puts it on column 1's top card; Enter selects there
key ArrowDown 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
save cursor
key Escape 1
frames 10
key KeyH 1
frames 10
save hint
frames 10
key KeyP 1
until 120 Resume
frames 10
save pause
click =Resume
frames 10
click =Restart
until 120 Restart this deal
frames 10
click =Yes
frames 30
click =Concede
until 120 Concede this deal?
frames 10
click =Yes
until 300 Deal conceded.
frames 10
save conceded
click =Leave
until 300 Daily Deal
